  "reviewFindingModelAskedForReviewTitle": "Model asked for review",
  "reviewFindingModelAskedNoReasonDetail": "It flagged the image but gave no reason.",
  "reviewFindingReasonSeparator": "; ",
  "@reviewFindingReasonSeparator": {
    "description": "What goes between the Model’s reasons when it gave more than one. The reasons are the Model’s own words and cannot be a whole message here; a list of unknown length has no sentence form, so the punctuation between them is the one thing this file can get right. Chinese uses its own full-width semicolon."
